    <string name="guide_title">Guide: Playlists &amp; Pinned Media</string>
    <string name="guide_text"># Playlists &amp; Pinned Media\n\n- **Create Playlists**: Long-press any track in songs, albums, or artists to add it to a playlist.\n- **Pin Media**: Long-press any album or playlist to pin it to the top **PINNED** section of the Main Menu.\n- **Edit Playlists**: Long-press a playlist to change its cover, rename it, or reorder tracks.\n- **Collage Covers**: Playlists automatically build a 2x2 collage from track artwork unless a custom cover is picked.</string>

